WHY THIS LICENSE. A specification that a standards body or a competitor cannot
adopt, adapt and re-publish is not a specification; it is marketing. The
attribution requirement is the only condition, and it exists so that a claim of
conformance can be traced to the text it claims conformance with.

NOTE ON CONFORMANCE. This license grants no right to describe an implementation
as conformant. Conformance is a claim about a system, assessable against
conformance-requirements.yaml, and this document makes no assessment of any
implementation including its authors' own.
